/**
 * VimInstall — the install block of the DeepWorkPlan Vim page: the canonical
 * one-liner with a copy button, the consent-first promise, and an "inspect
 * before you run" recipe that shows the SHA-256 of the installer exactly as
 * the site serves it (computed at build time from public/vim/install.sh, so it
 * cannot drift). Embedded in src/content/kit/<lang>/vim.mdx.
 *
 * Static HTML/CSS; the only script is a small progressive-enhancement copy
 * button (no framework, no hydration directive). Language-keyed i18n with an
 * `en` fallback, per docs/DIAGRAM_COMPONENTS.md §4. Brand and technical terms
 * (Neovim, SHA-256, DWP_VIM_REF, shell commands) stay in English.
 */
